      "value": "@{62416ada8d8bf53a6df3b017|full_name}: the Canny mentions a list of suggestions for feature requests, the first one is to not submit multiple requests as one. I think a main reason for this is that they can reference Canny in their internal dev system. So if you think there should be a Canny for something, try searching or creating it.\n\nPersonally I keep avatar sounds firmly off, so I have no skin in the game.",
