      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "General Explanation to it:\n\nHaving more Control over it Audio is helpfull for a Few reasons:\n\nProbably the Most Important here:\n\nA Range Limit would allow to Adjust the Audio Sources, so Loud Global Avatar Audio is restricted to just a few Meters.\n\n2D to 3D can Allow people to also Track down the Person who plays the Loud Audio often also including Effects. Apart From that, those who generally dislike the sound of 2 Dimensional Audio can so make sure they always have it Directional 3D\n\nLimiting the Loudness by Normalization would mean silent Sounds become Louder and Loud sound more Silent.\n\nEither Helpfull for Accessibility or to have and Option to generally avoid having too Loud Audio.\n\nMaybe a Slider for the Amount.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
